; Example two-layer process for ESP32 modules, NOT a supplier capability claim. mm unless noted.
; Same as conservative.rules except drill_mm 0.2: the ESP32-WROOM-32E footprint's own thermal vias are
; 0.2 mm holes, so the fabricator must support 0.2 mm finished holes. Check yours before ordering.
(rules
 (trace_width_mm 0.25) (clearance_mm 0.25) (edge_mm 0.4)
 (via_diameter_mm 0.7) (drill_mm 0.2) (annular_mm 0.15)
 (hole_gap_mm 0.25) (max_aspect 8)
 (mask_expansion_mm 0.05) (mask_web_mm 0.1) (courtyard_gap_mm 0.25)
 (max_drop_v 0.05) (max_current_density_a_mm2 20)
 (max_height_mm 10) (power_derating 0.5) (voltage_derating 0.8))
